When you create a chart, Helm generates this standard structure:

my-chart/
├── Chart.yaml          # Metadata: chart name, version, description
├── values.yaml         # Default configuration values for your templates
├── charts/             # Dependency charts (sub-charts)
└── templates/          # Kubernetes manifest templates
    ├── deployment.yaml # Templated Deployment
    ├── service.yaml    # Templated Service
    ├── ingress.yaml    # Templated Ingress
    ├── _helpers.tpl    # Reusable template snippets and naming logic
    └── NOTES.txt       # Post-installation instructions printed to terminal

